## Context

Reported from an arena session (raid 4f385e on arena ticket 1111, 2026-11-01). In
`skills/raid/SKILL.md` § Phase 2 the parallel Imagine agents end with "Wait for all.",
then a `### Blind-Spot pass (cross-ticket)` subsection follows. The orchestrator read this
as two steps and told the author "after Imagine comes the Blind-Spot pass". The author
corrected: the Blind-Spot pass is part of Imagine. The wording invites the misreading.

## Scope

Wording only, in `skills/raid/SKILL.md` § Phase 2: make the Blind-Spot pass read as the
closing step of Imagine (for example, open § Phase 2 with its two steps, per-ticket
reimagine then cross-ticket blind spot, and move "Wait for all" so it does not read as the
phase's end). No change to what the pass does. Coordinate with 1415 (Imagine skill
tracker), which may absorb this.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] § Phase 2 names the Blind-Spot pass as part of Imagine; a reader cannot take it for a separate phase
